div(class="space-y-8")
    div(*ngIf="loading", class="flex min-h-[18rem] items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50")
        p(class="text-sm text-slate-500") SSO 정보를 불러오는 중...

    div(*ngIf="!loading && (mode === 'input' || mode === 'idp-init')", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-6")
            p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-orange-600") Sign in flow
            h2(class="mt-1.5 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950") SAML 로그인 확인
            p(class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") 시작 위치를 선택한 뒤 AuthnRequest를 확인하고 SAMLResponse를 만듭니다.

        nav(class="grid gap-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 p-1 sm:grid-cols-2", aria-label="SSO 시작 방식")
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition", [class]="mode === 'input' ? 'bg-white text-orange-700 shadow-sm' : 'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900'", (click)="mode = 'input'; service.render()") SP에서 시작
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition", [class]="mode === 'idp-init' ? 'bg-white text-orange-700 shadow-sm' : 'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900'", (click)="mode = 'idp-init'; service.render()") IdP에서 시작

        div(*ngIf="mode === 'input'", class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem]")
            section(class="space-y-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6")
                div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                    span(class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white") 1
                    h3(class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") AuthnRequest 입력
                label(class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") SAMLRequest · Base64
                    textarea([(ngModel)]="samlRequestInput", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", rows="9", placeholder="SP가 보낸 SAMLRequest를 붙여넣으세요.", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-slate-950 p-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-slate-100 placeholder:text-slate-500 focus:border-orange-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-100")
                div(class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2")
                    label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Binding
                        select([(ngModel)]="bindingInput", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                            option(value="POST") HTTP-POST
                            option(value="Redirect") HTTP-Redirect
                    label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") RelayState
                        input([(ngModel)]="relayStateInput", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm", placeholder="선택 사항")
                div(class="flex justify-end")
                    button(type="button", [disabled]="!samlRequestInput.trim()", class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-orange-600 disabled:opacity-50", (click)="parseRequest()") 요청 확인
            aside(class="h-fit space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6")
                div
                    h3(class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") 진행 순서
                    ol(class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600")
                        li 1. Base64 요청 입력
                        li 2. Issuer·ACS·서명 확인
                        li 3. 사용자와 응답 설정 선택
                        li 4. SAMLResponse 생성
                p(*ngIf="supplementalLoading", class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-500") 최근 요청을 불러오는 중...
                details(*ngIf="transactions.length > 0", class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white")
                    summary(class="cursor-pointer px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700") 최근 요청 {{transactions.length}}건
                    div(class="max-h-64 divide-y divide-slate-100 overflow-auto border-t border-slate-200 px-3")
                        div(*ngFor="let transaction of transactions", class="py-3")
                            div(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2")
                                span(class="truncate text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700") {{transaction.sp_entity_id}}
                                span(class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold", [class]="transaction.status === 'success' ? 'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700' : transaction.status === 'pending' ? 'bg-amber-50 text-amber-700' : 'bg-slate-100 text-slate-600'") {{transaction.status}}

        div(*ngIf="mode === 'idp-init'", class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem]")
            section(class="space-y-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6")
                div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                    span(class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white") 1
                    h3(class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") 대상 선택
                label(class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") SP
                    select([(ngModel)]="selectedSpId", (ngModelChange)="onSpChange()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                        option(value="") SP를 선택하세요
                        option(*ngFor="let sp of spList", [value]="sp.id") {{sp.entity_id}}
                div(*ngIf="selectedSpAcs", class="rounded-xl border border-orange-100 bg-orange-50 p-4")
                    p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700") ACS URL
                    p(class="mt-1 break-all text-sm text-slate-700") {{selectedSpAcs}}
                label(class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") 테스트 사용자
                    select([(ngModel)]="selectedUserId", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                        option(value="") 사용자를 선택하세요
                        option(*ngFor="let user of users", [value]="user.id") {{user.username}} · {{user.display_name || user.email}}
                div(class="flex justify-end")
                    button(type="button", [disabled]="!selectedSpId || !selectedUserId", class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-orange-600 disabled:opacity-50", (click)="startIdpInitiated()") 응답 설정으로 이동
            aside(class="h-fit rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6")
                h3(class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") IdP 시작 SSO
                p(class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") AuthnRequest 없이 선택한 SP의 첫 ACS URL로 SAMLResponse를 보냅니다.

    div(*ngIf="!loading && mode === 'respond' && parsedRequest", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4")
            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-700", aria-label="SSO 입력으로", (click)="showInput()")
                svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") 로그인 확인 / 응답 설정
                h2(class="mt-0.5 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950") SAMLResponse 만들기

        div(class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[18rem_minmax(0,1fr)]")
            aside(class="h-fit space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 xl:sticky xl:top-[4.75rem]")
                div
                    p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400") 요청한 SP
                    p(class="mt-2 break-all text-sm font-bold leading-6 text-slate-900") {{parsedRequest.issuer}}
                div(class="space-y-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 text-sm")
                    div
                        p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") ACS URL
                        p(class="mt-1 break-all leading-5 text-slate-700") {{parsedRequest.acs_url}}
                    div
                        p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") Request ID
                        p(class="mt-1 break-all font-mono text-xs text-slate-600") {{parsedRequest.request_id || 'IdP 시작'}}
                div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                    span(*ngIf="parsedRequest.force_authn", class="rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800") ForceAuthn
                    span(*ngIf="parsedRequest.is_passive", class="rounded-full bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-violet-800") IsPassive
                    span(class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold", [class]="parsedRequest.signature_valid ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800'") {{parsedRequest.signature_valid ? '서명 확인됨' : '서명 미확인'}}
                ul(*ngIf="parsedRequest.warnings?.length", class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-800")
                    li(*ngFor="let warning of parsedRequest.warnings") {{warning}}

            section(class="space-y-7 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6")
                div
                    div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                        span(class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white") 1
                        h3(class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") 사용자와 NameID
                    div(class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2")
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") 테스트 사용자
                            select([(ngModel)]="selectedUserId", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                                option(value="") 사용자를 선택하세요
                                option(*ngFor="let user of users", [value]="user.id") {{user.username}} · {{user.display_name || user.email}}
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Attribute 세트
                            select([(ngModel)]="selectedPresetId", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                                option(value="") 사용자 기본값
                                option(*ngFor="let preset of presets", [value]="preset.id") {{preset.name}}
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") NameID Format
                            select([(ngModel)]="nameidFormat", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                                option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:1.1:nameid-format:emailAddress") emailAddress
                                option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:nameid-format:persistent") persistent
                                option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:nameid-format:transient") transient
                                option(value="urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:1.1:nameid-format:unspecified") unspecified
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") NameID 값 · 선택
                            input([(ngModel)]="nameidValue", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm", placeholder="비워두면 사용자 값 사용")

                div(class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-5")
                    div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                        span(class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white") 2
                        h3(class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") 인증 방식
                    div(class="mt-3 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3")
                        button(*ngFor="let option of authnContextOptions", type="button", class="rounded-xl border px-3 py-3 text-left text-sm font-semibold transition", [class]="authnContextClassRef === option.value ? 'border-orange-300 bg-orange-50 text-orange-800' : 'border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600 hover:border-orange-200'", (click)="setAuthnContextClassRef(option.value)") {{option.label}}
                    input([(ngModel)]="authnContextClassRef", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-3 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs", placeholder="AuthnContextClassRef")

                div(class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-5")
                    div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                        span(class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white") 3
                        h3(class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") 보호 방식
                    div(class="mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3")
                        label(class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700")
                            input(type="checkbox", [(ngModel)]="signResponse", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-orange-500")
                            span Response 서명
                        label(class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700")
                            input(type="checkbox", [(ngModel)]="signAssertion", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-orange-500")
                            span Assertion 서명
                        label(class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700")
                            input(type="checkbox", [(ngModel)]="encryptAssertion", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", [disabled]="!selectedSpSupportsEncryption()", class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-orange-500 disabled:opacity-50")
                            span EncryptedAssertion
                    p(*ngIf="!selectedSpSupportsEncryption()", class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-amber-700") 선택한 SP에 Encryption 인증서가 없어 Assertion 암호화를 사용할 수 없습니다.

                details(class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50")
                    summary(class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800")
                        span 고급 응답 설정
                        span(class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 group-open:hidden") 필요할 때 펼치기
                        span(class="hidden text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 group-open:inline") 접기
                    div(class="grid gap-4 border-t border-slate-200 p-4 md:grid-cols-2")
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Content encryption
                            select([(ngModel)]="contentEncryptionAlgorithm", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", [disabled]="!encryptAssertion", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm disabled:bg-slate-100")
                                option(value="aes256-gcm") AES-256-GCM · 권장
                                option(value="aes192-gcm") AES-192-GCM
                                option(value="aes128-gcm") AES-128-GCM
                                option(value="aes256-cbc") AES-256-CBC · 호환 시험
                                option(value="aes192-cbc") AES-192-CBC · 호환 시험
                                option(value="aes128-cbc") AES-128-CBC · 호환 시험
                                option(value="tripledes-cbc") TripleDES-CBC · 호환 시험
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Key transport
                            select([(ngModel)]="keyTransportAlgorithm", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", [disabled]="!encryptAssertion", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm disabled:bg-slate-100")
                                option(value="rsa-oaep-sha256") RSA-OAEP SHA-256 · 권장
                                option(value="rsa-oaep-sha1") RSA-OAEP SHA-1 · 호환 시험
                                option(value="rsa-1_5") RSA v1.5 · 호환 시험
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") 응답 형태
                            select([(ngModel)]="responseVariant", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                                option(value="standard") 표준 응답
                                option(value="wrong_issuer") Issuer 불일치
                                option(value="wrong_audience") Audience 불일치
                                option(value="expired") 만료됨
                                option(value="future_not_before") 미래 NotBefore
                                option(value="unsigned") 서명 없음
                                option(value="bad_ciphertext") Ciphertext 변조
                                option(value="authn_failed") AuthnFailed
                                option(value="no_authn_context") NoAuthnContext
                                option(value="request_denied") RequestDenied
                                option(value="responder") Responder
                        div(class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3")
                            label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") 만료(초)
                                input(type="number", [(ngModel)]="assertionTtlSeconds", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                            label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") 시간 이동
                                input(type="number", [(ngModel)]="timeOffsetSeconds", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") SessionIndex
                            input([(ngModel)]="sessionIndex", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm", placeholder="비워두면 자동 생성")
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") AuthenticatingAuthority · 한 줄에 하나
                            textarea([(ngModel)]="authenticatingAuthoritiesText", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", rows="3", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white p-3 text-sm")
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 md:col-span-2") Attribute Override JSON
                            textarea([(ngModel)]="attributeOverrides", (ngModelChange)="service.render()", rows="6", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white p-3 font-mono text-xs leading-5", placeholder="{}")
                        div(*ngIf="samlAttributeCatalog.length", class="md:col-span-2")
                            p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") 자주 쓰는 Attribute 추가
                            div(class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                                button(*ngFor="let attribute of samlAttributeCatalog.slice(0, 10)", type="button", class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 hover:border-orange-200 hover:text-orange-700", (click)="insertAttributeOverride(attribute)") {{attribute.friendly_name || attribute.urn}}

                div(class="flex justify-end border-t border-slate-200 pt-4")
                    button(type="button", [disabled]="!selectedUserId || loading", class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-orange-600 disabled:opacity-50", (click)="buildResponse()") SAMLResponse 생성

    div(*ngIf="!loading && mode === 'result' && responseResult", class="space-y-6")
        header(class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between")
            div(class="flex items-center gap-3")
                button(type="button", class="rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-700", aria-label="SSO 입력으로", (click)="showInput()")
                    svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor")
                        path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18")
                div
                    p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") 로그인 확인 / 결과
                    h2(class="mt-0.5 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950") SAMLResponse 생성 결과
            span(class="rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold", [class]="responseResult.standards_status === 'standard' ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800'") {{responseResult.standards_status === 'standard' ? '표준' : '호환 시험'}}

        div(class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3")
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") Response
                p(class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") {{responseResult.signed_response ? '서명됨' : '서명 없음'}}
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") Assertion
                p(class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") {{responseResult.signed_assertion ? '서명됨' : '서명 없음'}}
            div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500") 암호화
                p(class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900") {{responseResult.encrypted_assertion ? responseResult.content_encryption_algorithm : '사용 안 함'}}

        div(class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem]")
            div(class="space-y-5")
                section(class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6")
                    h3(class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950") 전송 대상
                    p(class="mt-2 break-all text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700") {{responseResult.acs_url}}
                    p(*ngIf="responseResult.relay_state", class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500") RelayState · {{responseResult.relay_state}}
                section(*ngIf="responseResult.attributes", class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6")
                    h3(class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950") Attribute
                    div(class="mt-3 divide-y divide-slate-100")
                        div(*ngFor="let key of objectKeys(responseResult.attributes)", class="grid gap-1 py-2.5 text-sm sm:grid-cols-[12rem_minmax(0,1fr)]")
                            span(class="font-semibold text-slate-600") {{key}}
                            span(class="break-all text-slate-800") {{stringify(responseResult.attributes[key])}}
                details(class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50")
                    summary(class="cursor-pointer px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800") SAMLResponse 원문
                    div(class="border-t border-slate-200 p-5")
                        div(class="mb-3 flex justify-end gap-2")
                            button(type="button", class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700", (click)="toggleRawResponse()") {{showRawResponse ? '숨기기' : '표시'}}
                            button(*ngIf="showRawResponse", type="button", class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700", (click)="copyText(responseResult.response_xml)") XML 복사
                        pre(class="max-h-80 overflow-auto rounded-xl bg-slate-950 p-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-slate-200") {{showRawResponse ? responseResult.response_xml : '민감한 Attribute 값이 숨겨져 있습니다.'}}
            aside(class="h-fit space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6")
                div
                    p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400") Response ID
                    p(class="mt-2 break-all font-mono text-xs leading-5 text-slate-600") {{responseResult.response_id}}
                div
                    p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400") Assertion ID
                    p(class="mt-2 break-all font-mono text-xs leading-5 text-slate-600") {{responseResult.assertion_id || '없음'}}
                div(*ngIf="responseResult.warnings?.length", class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-3")
                    ul(class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-4 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-800")
                        li(*ngFor="let warning of responseResult.warnings") {{warning}}
